  "id": "peritraumatic-dissociation",
  "term": "peritraumatic dissociation",
  "definition": "Peritraumatic dissociation is a psychological reaction during or around a traumatic event in which a person may experience disruptions in awareness, memory, or sense of identity. It has been linked with poorer outcomes such as post-traumatic stress disorder.",
